;; Offline replay of the Librarian read rules over a live workspace (RFC
;; librarian-lifecycle §9). Reads the turn-boundary logs and the checkpoints
;; they name, runs Keeper_librarian_range.select/slice round after round, and
;; prints how many rounds a backlog takes, how many atoms each carries and
;; whether any atom is carried twice. Counts only -- the input is every Keeper
;; conversation on the machine, so message text never reaches the output.
;; Writes nothing: no progress file, no boundary line, no checkpoint.
(executable
 (name masc_librarian_replay)
 (modules masc_librarian_replay)
 (public_name masc-librarian-replay)
 (package masc)
 (libraries masc masc_core masc.config_dir_resolver masc.agent_core masc.keeper_registry yojson unix))

